WEBVTT

00:00.160 --> 00:01.400
Right

00:01.480 --> 00:02.880
This Yong'an

00:03.720 --> 00:05.440
Isn't too far from Yiyang

00:06.760 --> 00:08.160
I'll take you

00:08.520 --> 00:09.800
To break willow branches

00:09.880 --> 00:11.880
And enjoy flowers, how about that?

00:20.200 --> 00:21.840
What I promised you

00:22.680 --> 00:24.080
I've always remembered

00:25.880 --> 00:27.440
Never forgotten

00:32.720 --> 00:34.120
Wait a moment

00:34.720 --> 00:36.120
It's cold here

00:36.360 --> 00:38.027
I'll get you a cloak

00:59.480 --> 01:00.880
Ruolan

01:06.600 --> 01:08.000
Ruolan

01:09.160 --> 01:10.560
Ruolan

01:17.000 --> 01:18.400
Ruolan

01:52.760 --> 01:54.160
First wish

01:55.360 --> 01:57.360
My lord live ten thousand years

01:58.600 --> 02:01.400
Second wish, the heir always healthy

02:02.400 --> 02:04.960
Third wish, to become swallows on the beam

02:05.960 --> 02:07.720
Year after year

02:08.760 --> 02:10.160
Always together

02:10.880 --> 02:13.080
They all say the ends of the earth

02:13.160 --> 02:15.360
And corners of the earth have limits

02:18.240 --> 02:19.640
My longing

02:22.400 --> 02:24.880
Has finally reached its end

